DEPLOYMENT_PROFILE=onprem \
MINIO_ENDPOINT_URL=http://localhost:9000 \
MINIO_ACCESS_KEY=minioadmin \
MINIO_SECRET_KEY=minioadmin \
  python -m pytest runs/kit/REQ-001/test/ \
    -m integration -k "Onprem" \
    -v --tb=short
```

Expected: on-prem integration tests pass (put/get/delete object).

## 5. Run all tests together

```bash
