```bash
ruff check runs/kit/REQ-001/src/ runs/kit/REQ-001/test/
mypy runs/kit/REQ-001/src/ --strict --ignore-missing-imports
```

## 7. Cleanup

```bash
docker rm -f localstack minio
```

